 Your Parents"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbYZ7gxuIk_text","label":"ggbYZ7gxuIk_text","default":"<p>Parents are often the quiet heroes behind a wedding. From supporting you throughout your life to celebrating one of your biggest milestones, their love and encouragement deserve to be recognized.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>A personalized Memobrick created from a cherished family photo, a wedding portrait, or a meaningful moment shared together transforms those memories into a keepsake they'll proudly display for years. Every time they see it, they'll be reminded not only of your wedding day but also of the incredible journey that brought your family to that moment.</p>"}],
